# Test: a live refresh waits while a row of the content is ticked
# VALIDATES: spec-fleet-ui-1 user story 4 with the closure review's live
#            refresh finding -- an event that makes the content stale does
#            not discard what the operator chose in the browser: a ticked row
#            keeps the content as drawn, and the refresh lands once the row
#            is unticked
# PREVENTS: a stream event that re-fetches the content and drops the rows an
#           operator ticked for a bulk action
#
# Goal: prove the content region holds its refresh while it holds browser
# state, and applies it when that state is gone.
# Method: the review build starts with its sample script held, so the estate
# changes only when the header's Step is pressed. core-par-02 is offline from
# the start (sample/estate.go offlineFor), so the devices table filtered to
# state:offline holds its row; the script's first step takes cpe-lon-03
# offline, which adds it to that table. The test ticks core-par-02, steps,
# and waits for the root's data-fleet-held, which fleet.js sets when a
# refresh waits: the table still lacks cpe-lon-03 at that point. Unticking
# the row releases the refresh, and the table then shows cpe-lon-03. Every
# wait is on state the page shows, never on a time.

option=needs-build-tag:value=ze_fleet_ui_sample:state=present
option=env:var=ze.web.fleet.sample.held:value=true
option=timeout:value=90s
option=viewport:width=1600:height=1000

action=open:path=/fleet/estate/devices/?q=state%3Aoffline
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=core-par-02
expect=html:id=fleet-content:not-contains=cpe-lon-03
expect=attribute:selector=html:name=data-fleet-stream:value=open

action=click:text=Select core-par-02
expect=attribute:selector=tr.fleet-table-row--selected:name=class:contains=fleet-table-row--selected

# Step 1: cpe-lon-03 goes offline, and the content is stale. Its refresh waits.
action=click:id=fleet-proto-step
expect=attribute:selector=html:name=data-fleet-held:value=true
expect=html:id=fleet-content:not-contains=cpe-lon-03
expect=attribute:selector=tr.fleet-table-row--selected:name=class:contains=fleet-table-row--selected

# Unticked, the content holds nothing of the browser's: the refresh lands.
action=click:text=Select core-par-02
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=cpe-lon-03
